# @file Satake Mei - Romance
# @author 黑奴队长（临时）
# @author Katze (translator)

# @author 黑奴队长
# @author Katze (translator)
49:
  title: Dream of the Arc
  lines:
    - That weekend, %CHARA% invited %YOU% out.
    - The stated reason was to discuss the next overseas expedition, yet %SEX% and %YOU% sat across from one another in a private restaurant booth, lost for words.
    - After a long silence, %SEX% finally thanked %YOU% for all the effort devoted to the overseas campaign.
    - if: d.who_am_i === 1
      content: Although the Prix de l'Arc de Triomphe crown was already yours, many more dreams still awaited.
    - if: d.who_am_i === 0
      content: Although the Prix de l'Arc de Triomphe crown remained out of reach, %YOU% would surely make that dream come true one day.
    - Whatever happened, %YOU% was %SEX% most cherished partner in chasing that dream.
    - if: d.who_am_i !== 2
      lines:
        - Drawing a deep breath as if coming to a decision, %SEX% slowly removed her hat, revealing a pair of horse ears.
        - %SEX% confessed that the true name was %CHARA_ACTUAL% and apologized to %YOU% for hiding it for so long, hoping you could be more open with each other from then on.
    - At last, %SEX% raised a cup to %YOU%.
    - Behind the steam rising from the coffee, a trace of affection flickered in those eyes.
